  "name": "Charred Corn, Chicken and Tortilla Salad with Chipotle Yogurt Dressing",
  "subtitle": "A smoky chicken salad with crisp tortillas and a creamy chile dressing.",
  "description": "Marinated chicken, charred corn and lettuce, black beans, tomatoes, and avocado come together with crunchy tortilla strips and a smoky yogurt dressing.",
